-code builds, redesigns, or product UI work to clarify missing product information and play back the brief before proceeding.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/get-context", "title": "Get Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/get-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76", "plugin_name": "product-design", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6ab53765b77c8191b08bdc8611976edc", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6ab5377185cc8191bbb99231ba0cb95d", "skill_name": "get-context", "contents": [], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Initialize, inspect, save, update, forget, export, or explicitly reset the Investment Banking plugin's local user context, source setup, or optional automation setup. Use only when the user explicitly asks to manage Investment Banking saved preferences, source pointers, context storage, or recurring automation.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1/user-context", "title": "Investment Banking User Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1/user-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1", "plugin_name": "investment-banking", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6a9762f9fe308191b4fed932e04e5430", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6a9762fb83d08191a0f0418350cc3ec5", "skill_name": "user-context", "contents": ["plugin-author-config", "references", "scripts", "tests"], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Load or manage Product Design's saved user context. Use when the user asks to set up Product Design, get started, onboard, save product or design sources, see what Product Design remembers, update saved context, or remember Product Design preferences. Examples include product URLs, Figma files, screenshots, reference images, codebase paths, Storybook, tokens, design systems, brand assets, and general product/design notes.", "mim